{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Kendoshi 是一款為個人與小團隊而設的視覺化專案管理工具，以看板、群組與表格整理工作，並透過 My Day 與日曆規劃日程。單人使用時無需帳戶或伺服器，資料儲存在私人 iCloud，並在 Mac、iPhone 與 iPad 之間同步；團隊模式屬可選項目。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>視覺化看板與自然語法輸入</h2>\n<p>專案以看板形式組織，配合群組、狀態標籤與表格檢視，可用拖放調整次序，或將群組與專案複製成範本。新增任務只需一行自然語法，即可同時設定日期、時間、優先次序、專案與重複規則，英文與德文皆可辨識。My Day 以時段規劃當日工作，日曆提供日、週、月與時間軸檢視，任務可啟動 5 至 60 分鐘專注計時。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-165-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-166-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-167-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-168-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-169-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-170-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Kendoshi</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:02.958472+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":358,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T23:46:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:08.370279+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:08.370279+00:00","content_hash":"2d0aa2c8382c222d51e698818bc0228fd6ea0fa1e818528a2daa03d33fe97e4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}